 President Joseph Kabila has joined a new political-military front that brings together the Rwandan-backed AFC/M23 coalition. Analysts say it could reshape opposition to President Felix Tshisekedi.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>India: Can 'cockroaches' threaten Modi's political grip?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e9af6e815e6d00a4131d9f940b5ac0d7d3eddbc3c52865eae1b23ec6859ec17a</id><updated>2026-10-13T16:09:05Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T15:20:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-can-cockroaches-threaten-modi-s-political-grip/a-79649732--1196fbece1f4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-can-cockroaches-threaten-modi-s-political-grip/a-79649732?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Thousands detained, leaders arrested on arrival, and a capital under lockdown: the youth-led protests against the election chief have the attention of the Indian government. But experts say toppling it is another matter.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>US Ambassador to Greece Kimberly Guilfoye resigns amid misconduct allegations</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:27a4e5ccf3a22e01bf2818a3b6d7beb55800a48c6b5398ad7604a70cbe6a8117</id><updated>2026-10-13T16:09:08Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T14:37:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-ambassador-to-greece-kimberly-guilfoye-resigns-amid-misconduct-allegations/a-79652952--47b35173a392.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-ambassador-to-greece-kimberly-guilfoye-resigns-amid-misconduct-allegations/a-79652952?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Kimberly Guilfoyle has resigned as US ambassador to Greece. President Trump previously said he was unhappy with her amid reports of a bribery scandal and ethics violations.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Nuremberg airport briefly closed after in-flight emergency</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:eac2a16d5fd0e9f9e335e72528aea732375b780387c4f83587c67b2fff4cfcc8</id><updated>2026-10-13T16:09:11Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T13:34:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nuremberg-airport-briefly-closed-after-in-flight-emergency/a-79649580--a029343e2cff.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nuremberg-airport-briefly-closed-after-in-flight-emergency/a-79649580?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Police are investigating a suspected in-flight emergency on a Corfu flight. After the airport reopened, the airline said they believed the emergency code was a result of a technical malfunction.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Nord Stream: Germany puts suspected Ukrainian pipeline saboteur on trial</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1a2f36fc9a9715c9f7b751846c461cf6e2774b025678a5ed129cb1a0ce63c3d9</id><updated>2026-10-13T16:09:15Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T12:40:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nord-stream-germany-puts-suspected-ukrainian-pipeline-saboteur-on-trial/a-79647617--ad974b48960d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nord-stream-germany-puts-suspected-ukrainian-pipeline-saboteur-on-trial/a-79647617?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A Ukrainian citizen faces court in Hamburg, accused of attacking the Nord Stream gas pipelines in 2022. It raises questions about Kyiv's possible role in the explosions. German support for Ukraine is also under scrutiny.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Critics warn of espionage risks as Slovakia restores military-diplomatic representation with Russia</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1a8210403ddcf3fe5586fd9fe18cc4e87c521056ee6e010d1f201726aba6a67b</id><updated>2026-10-13T16:09:18Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T12:04:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.